{"id":"421255505c63a270","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-simple-homotopy.md","title":"Simple Homotopy","display":"df-simple-homotopy — Simple Homotopy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-simple-homotopy","aliases":["58-df-simple-homotopy"],"display":"df-simple-homotopy — Simple Homotopy","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-attaching-map.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-simple-homotopy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-simple-homotopy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simple-homotopy — Simple Homotopy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9c7e703f871c9421\" href=\"?note=9c7e703f871c9421\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md\">../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36a464dda4de9f60\" href=\"?note=36a464dda4de9f60\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-attaching-map.md\">../batch08/58-df-attaching-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in V\">\\(X,Y\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\omega\">\\(n,m\\in\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9c7e703f871c9421\" href=\"?note=9c7e703f871c9421\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md\">../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AttachingMap}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{AttachingMap}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36a464dda4de9f60\" href=\"?note=36a464dda4de9f60\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-attaching-map.md\">../batch08/58-df-attaching-map.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemExpansion}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ElemExpansion}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemMoveSeq}_S,\\mathrm{ElemCollapse}_S,\\mathrm{SimpleHomotopyEq}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ElemMoveSeq}_S,\\mathrm{ElemCollapse}_S,\\mathrm{SimpleHomotopyEq}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}expansion} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElemExpansion}_S(X,Y,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\exists\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi,\\tau_Y,\\vec Y,\\vec\\Psi,\\phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi)\\land\n\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\vec Y,\\vec\\Psi)\\land\n\\mathrm{AttachingMap}_S(\\phi,X,\\tau_X,n)\\land Y=X\\cup_{\\phi}D^n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}expansion} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElemExpansion}_S(X,Y,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\exists\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi,\\tau_Y,\\vec Y,\\vec\\Psi,\\phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi)\\land\n\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\vec Y,\\vec\\Psi)\\land\n\\mathrm{AttachingMap}_S(\\phi,X,\\tau_X,n)\\land Y=X\\cup_{\\phi}D^n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}collapse} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElemCollapse}_S(X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\mathrm{ElemExpansion}_S(Y,X,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}collapse} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElemCollapse}_S(X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\mathrm{ElemExpansion}_S(Y,X,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}moves} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElemMoveSeq}_S(X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists Z\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(Z,m+1,\\operatorname{ran}(Z))\\land\nZ(0)=X\\land Z(m)=Y\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\bigl((\\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\mathrm{ElemExpansion}_S(Z(i),Z(i+1),k))\\lor\n\\mathrm{ElemCollapse}_S(Z(i),Z(i+1))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}moves} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElemMoveSeq}_S(X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists Z\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(Z,m+1,\\operatorname{ran}(Z))\\land\nZ(0)=X\\land Z(m)=Y\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\bigl((\\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\mathrm{ElemExpansion}_S(Z(i),Z(i+1),k))\\lor\n\\mathrm{ElemCollapse}_S(Z(i),Z(i+1))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}homotopy} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimpleHomotopyEq}_S(X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElemMoveSeq}_S(X,Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}homotopy} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimpleHomotopyEq}_S(X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElemMoveSeq}_S(X,Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Simple homotopy equivalence preserves Whitehead torsion.</li>\n<li>Whitehead torsion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(X) = 0\">\\(\\tau(X) = 0\\)</span> for finite CW complexes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iff\">\\(\\iff\\)</span> simple homotopy equivalent to a point.</li>\n<li>Homeomorphisms are simple homotopy equivalences.</li>\n<li>Exotic spheres: h-cobordant but not diffeomorphic spheres.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"9c7e703f871c9421","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-attaching-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"36a464dda4de9f60","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-attaching-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"9c7e703f871c9421","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch0